      "narrative": "Union, a Seed-stage Defense & Security company founded by Will Somerindyke, Jon Reiland, and Joe Musselman, has raised $51.3M to date. The valuation analysis draws on a comp universe of 10 peers across the sector: 2 public companies (DRSHF, IDEAFORGE.NS) and 8 private firms including UFORCE, Anduril Industries, Helsing, Shield AI, and Saronic.\n\nTwo valuation methods were applied. Stage-progression uses the $51.3M raised as a proxy base and applies a 2.5x multiplier typical of Seed-to-next-stage advancement, implying $128M. Peer-median triangulation across three same-sector, same/adjacent-stage comparables (UFORCE at $1.0B Seed-stage; Singularity at $400M Series A; NODA AI at $125M Series A) yields a median of $400M, with a range of $125M\u2013$1.0B.\n\nSynthesizing both methods produces a triangulated valuation range of $109M (low) to $460M (high), with a median of $264M. The wide spread reflects material dispersion in the peer set, particularly UFORCE's outsized Seed valuation. Key uncertainties include the appropriateness of using total capital raised as a valuation proxy at Seed stage, the comparability of peers operating across differing Defense & Security sub-verticals, and whether near-term financing activity will tighten or broaden this range.",
