      "narrative": "Together AI is a Series A AI & Software company founded by Vipul Ved Prakash, Ce Zhang, Chris R\u00e9, and Percy Liang, currently valued at $8.3B post-money after raising $530M. The valuation assessment draws on a peer universe of 9 private and 1 public comparable (Palantir), including frontier-tech peers such as Reflection AI, Physical Intelligence, and Black Forest Labs.\n\nTwo triangulation methods were applied. Stage-progression analysis, using a 2.0x multiplier typical for Series A advancement, implies a forward valuation of $16.6B from the current $8.3B base. Peer-median analysis across three same-sector, same/adjacent-stage comparables yields $5.6B, with the peer set ranging from $3.2B (Black Forest Labs, Series B) to $25.0B (Reflection AI, Series A).\n\nThe triangulated analysis supports a valuation range of $4.8B to $19.1B, with a median of $11.1B. The wide dispersion reflects material uncertainty around stage-up expectations and material heterogeneity in peer valuations\u2014particularly the $25.0B outlier for Reflection AI relative to the $5.6B median. Key sensitivities include the appropriateness of the 2.0x stage multiplier for the current market environment and whether peer comps adequately reflect Together AI's specific technology positioning and capital efficiency relative to the broader frontier-AI cohort.",
