      "narrative": "Onodrim Industries is a seed-stage Defense & Security company founded by Aistis \u0160imaitis, Alexander Blessing, and Christian Garrett. The company has raised \u20ac40M to date. The valuation analysis draws from a comparable universe of 10 private and 2 public companies operating in the same sector at seed and Series A stages, including peers such as UFORCE, Anduril Industries, Helsing, Shield AI, and Saronic.\n\nThe peer-median method was applied as the primary valuation approach. Analysis of three same-sector, same/adjacent-stage comparables\u2014UFORCE (seed, $1.0B), Singularity (Series A, $400M), and NODA AI (Series A, $125M)\u2014yielded a median valuation of $400M, with a range spanning $125M to $1.0B. This method directly reflects the capital intensity and risk profile typical of frontier defense technologies at this stage.\n\nThe triangulated analysis, based on the single applicable methodology, supports a valuation range of $340M (low) to $460M (high), with a midpoint of $400M. Key uncertainties include the company's commercial traction, IP differentiation within the crowded frontier defense sector, and customer acquisition progress relative to the peer set. Limited public comps (2 tickers) and concentration among 8 private peers warrant sensitivity to market recalibration in early-stage defense venture funding.",
